#VRML V2.0 utf8
# Project-authored behavior fixture (oracle/standards/README.md). REGRESSION_ONLY, tag behavior.
# Clause numbers are those of the Web3D free copy of ISO/IEC 14772-1:1997; equality with the ISO text UNVERIFIED.
# 4.5.2: if no interpretable URL is located, the node type defines the resultant default behaviour.
# 6.25 Inline states no result for that case, and a missing child does not make this file invalid.
# This file records what an implementation does. It asserts no ISO result.
DEF Missing Inline {
  url [ "absent-missing-child.wrl"
        "http://inline-missing.invalid/child.wrl" ]
}
DEF Present Shape { geometry Sphere { radius 0.25 } }
